Package: amber-ols
Version: @VERSION@-@REVISION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Hyperquader <hyperquader@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/DanielGavin/ols
Description: Odin language server (ols) built against amber-odin
 The ols language server compiled from source with the exact Odin compiler
 shipped in the matching amber-odin package, so the pair cannot skew. The
 packaged ols commit is recorded in the changelog.
 .
 Installs the server tree under /usr/lib/amber-ols and exposes /usr/bin/ols.
